  "body": "<a name=\"release-1-19-1-fixed\"></a>\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- Return a nonzero exit code and report failed removals when `pipx cache purge` cannot remove a cached environment ([#2499](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2499)) by @gaborbernat and @tolgacodes-dev.\n\n<a name=\"release-1-19-1-documentation\"></a>\n\n### Documentation\n\n- Preserve existing destinations in the Windows move guide and rebuild environments from the new pipx home ([#2500](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2500)) by @gaborbernat and @xhl123XHL352.\n\n[🐍 PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/pipx/1.19.1/)\n\n[📜 Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.19.0...1.19.1)\n",
